msgctxt "quest/007/GaiUsa302_00734:TEXT_GAIUSA302_00734_SEQ_01:1"
msgid "<ui-color 533><ui-edge-color 534><icon 63> This quest has been adjusted. Please abandon the quest and restart it by speaking to Teteroon at Memeroon's Trading Post.</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br><br>※The Main Scenario Guide shows the next available quest. You can toggle it on and off in Character Configuration, under UI Settings."
msgstr ""

#. ja: メメルン交易商店の「テテルン」に集めた材料を渡そう。
#. de: Bring die gesammelten Zutaten zu Teteroon an Memeroons Handelsposten.
#. fr: Apportez les matériaux à Teteroon, au comptoir de Memeroon.
#. kind: journal
msgctxt "quest/007/GaiUsa302_00734:TEXT_GAIUSA302_00734_SEQ_02:1"
msgid "You have procured the required ingredients. Take them back to Teteroon."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 冒険者の集めてきた材料で、<sheet EventItem 2000594 0>の仕込みができた。完成までは少し時間がかかるらしい。
#. de: Mit den von dir gesammelten Zutaten macht sich Teteroon sofort an die Arbeit. Es dauert aber ein bisschen, bis <noun-de EventItem 2 2000594 1 1 1> fertig gebraut ist, also sollst du später wiederkommen.
#. fr: Grâce aux ingrédients rassemblés par vos soins, <noun-fr EventItem 2 2000594 1 1> va pouvoir être terminé<if "<sheet EventItem 2000594 6>">e</if>. Il vous faudra cependant patienter un peu. 
#. kind: journal
msgctxt "quest/007/GaiUsa302_00734:TEXT_GAIUSA302_00734_SEQ_03:1"
msgid "Teteroon has set about brewing his Qiqirn firewater from the ingredients you have provided. But good firewater takes time. Speak to him again later to learn how his concoction turns out."
msgstr ""

#. ja: <ui-color 533><ui-edge-color 534><icon 63>本クエストは調整されました。一度破棄し、<br>メメルン交易商店のテテルンから再受注してください</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
